## Study control
##

    ## Study name(s)
    studyNames integrated
    
    ## Reference solution for error calculation
    sourceCase analytical
    
    ## Description to be appended to ReadMe.md
    description "Test Euler vs Integrated for d2dt2(rho, u) scheme, by solving wave equation and comparing the errors with the analytical solution"
